{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10626","headline":"大云寺赞公房四首 二 · 杜甫","name":"大云寺赞公房四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细软青丝履，光明白氎巾。\n深藏供老宿，取用及吾身。\n自顾转无趣，交情何尚新。\n道林才不世，惠远德过人。\n雨泻暮檐竹，风吹青井芹。\n天阴对图画，最觉润龙鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}